  "referenceNumber": "RUS2253",
  "remarks": "\nXIN QUAN ELECTRONICS (HONG KONG) CO., LIMITED is an involved person within the meaning of the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019: because it is or has been destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine, by making available goods or technology, that could contribute to destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine. \n",
